WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.697
A variable can contain a correct value without
showing anything on the screen The print

00:00:05.724 --> 00:00:12.320
function gives us a simple way to display text
variables and calculations During

00:00:12.347 --> 00:00:18.073
analysis print statements are useful for checking
intermediate results If a final

00:00:18.086 --> 00:00:22.270
metric looks wrong we can inspect earlier values and
see where the problem may have

00:00:22.297 --> 00:00:28.598
started Printing is also a basic communication tool
Instead

00:00:28.611 --> 00:00:33.216
of displaying an unexplained number we can attach a
label such as profit age or

00:00:33.243 --> 00:00:39.256
sales Later we will use tables and visualizations
but clear labels remain important

00:00:39.269 --> 00:00:41.716
in every form of analytical communication
